    strengths: ['You express yourself well in words or pictures', 'You are curious about people, society, and history', 'You think in fresh, creative, and caring ways'],
    subjects: 'History · Political Science · Psychology · Languages · Fine Arts (subjects vary by school)',
    careers: ['Lawyer', 'Teacher or professor', 'Journalist, writer, or content creator', 'Designer, artist, or media professional', 'Civil servant (IAS, IPS) and other government roles'],
